6. Downloaded proof assets (not embedded in the application)
========================================================================

- openac-age-v1 (Bonds R1CS and proving/verifying keys) and
  openac-age-graph-v1 (witness graphs) compile zkID circuits (MIT) and
  circomlib 2.0.5 templates (GPL-3.0-or-later). These assets are distributed
  separately under GPL-3.0, not linked into the wallet native library.
  Corresponding source: https://github.com/privacy-ethereum/zkID/tree/b395e09c225ff45b003f0087c28e2e208e22f944/wallet-unit-poc/circom and
  https://github.com/iden3/circomlib/tree/v2.0.5 ; @zk-email/circuits 6.3.4.
  Rebuild with native/openac-age/build-graphs.sh; source revisions, the
  secq256r1 patch and asset hashes are pinned in that package's VERSIONS.json.
- The BN254 CRS used by Barretenberg is the public Aztec Ignition ceremony
  transcript prefix; hashes are in native/zkpdf-prover/assets.json.

